<form class="reign-dialog-form">
  <div class="form-group reign-text-center reign-mb-medium">
    <label>Your Current Wealth</label>
    <div class="reign-wealth-display">{{currentWealth}}</div>
  </div>
  <div class="form-group">
    <label>Cost of the Item you want to buy (1-10):</label>
    <input type="number" name="cost" value="1" min="1" max="10"/>
  </div>
  <div class="reign-text-small reign-text-muted reign-mb-small">
    <strong>How Wealth purchases work:</strong><br>
    &bull; Cost <strong>below</strong> your Wealth &mdash; trivial, costs nothing<br>
    &bull; Cost <strong>equal to</strong> your Wealth &mdash; pay 1 Wealth, or roll Wealth / Haggle to keep it<br>
    &bull; Cost <strong>above</strong> your Wealth &mdash; beyond your means
  </div>
</form>
